  "foaf:name": "BLUE CONNECT",
  "sdo:name": "BLUE CONNECT",
  "sdo:description": "The BLUE CONNECT project aims to safeguard and restore marine habitats by addressing gaps in EU and global legislation and involving MPA managers, authorities, industries, and local communities in a coordinated approach to marine conservation. It will develop a Blueprint with step-by-step guidance and tools to define science-based conservation objectives, design and implement measures to meet them, and monitor their effectiveness. The approach will integrate biodiversity, ecosystem function, services, and connectivity, while also accounting for climate change impacts. Social, economic, and cultural insights from stakeholders and communities will inform the design of MPAs and ecological corridors.",
